This assert statement ensures that the indices passed to methods are within the valid range, i.e., they are greater than or equal to 0 and less than the current size of the list. 

If the index is outside this range, an `ArgumentOutOfRangeException` will be thrown, which can be caught and handled gracefully by the code that calls the method.
